<title>USA: Jefferson County, Ky., repriced, top yield cut.</title>
<headline>Jefferson County, Ky., repriced, top yield cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Jefferson County, Ky., $87 million Health Facilities revenue bonds, cutting the top yield in 2022 to 5.67 percent from 5.70, while raising yields in several other maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
